{"c":[{"id":"efc720c8ec4faf9a","sum":"host-env.test.ts scans only helper/src for process.env; helper/scripts/privacy-gate.ts reads its gate names via processEnv() and HELPER_ONLY_ENV, so new script env names go there. Tests await PageFocus.moved; EngineSession.onFocus drops that promise.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T094208Z-4d056099840ba76b","text":"host-env.test.ts scans only helper/src for process.env; helper/scripts/privacy-gate.ts still reads its build-gate names (CARET_INTERNAL_BUILD, CARET_*PRIVACY_RESOURCE) through processEnv() and HELPER_ONLY_ENV, so new script env names go there too.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T100347Z-137d3d2067c38ff7","text":"Tests can await PageFocus.moved for the walk/focus completion; EngineSession.onFocus discards that promise.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"49be5dc02d9c236a","sum":"G36: before loosening a fill guard, diff guard-adversary --verifier accepts vs base; oneOfSeveral blocks role-labelled phones. VS1: value questions reach only hellos with askValues and askChoices; realfill-asks scores AskAsks.fallback as automatic.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T103008Z-ae509cb3a9a659fb","text":"G36: before loosening a fill guard, diff guard-adversary --verifier accept attempts vs base; oneOfSeveral also blocks role-labelled people's phones (recruiter: Wren Ng, ...). page-w3 1f flaked once in the full fast suite, passes alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T103634Z-919e960bf3dcead3","text":"VS1: value questions reach only consumers whose hello declares askValues beside askChoices; realfill-asks scores a value question's AskAsks.fallback as the automatic result and its scripted picks as 'after pick'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
